{"reviewId": "276023870_86jKno1tt", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "第三库存周期”意味着什么？\n*   文中说：行情大概率出现在这个位置。\n*   **推演：**\n    *   **2026年（现在）：** 是第二库存周期的尾部，是**“坑”**。价格在磨底，甚至会阴跌。\n    *   **2027-2028年：** 进入第三库存周期。这时候，为了给下一个康波（2030年）做准备，全球可能会有一波**“设备更新”**或者**“补库存”**的小高潮。\n    *   **结果：** 大宗商品会在2027年左右迎来一次**“像样的反弹”**（注意：是反弹，不是反转）。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "30929-31002", "abstract": "从中周期的意义上看，每轮中周期大宗商品都会出现一次波段行情，而就这几个样本看，这个行情大概率会出现在中周期的末尾阶段，基本上位于第三库存周期位置。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "276023870_86jKno1tt", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768972225, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 912816141, "name": "石头", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/NAAhXpalVrb3SWC9btMjS0vwMXicC5ibmb8zK5nRytjzM8mRmH7u92h6SOQmYkvh0LWuT8qUHjwovYQR71J68TpicWO1VDZXibygTQWERyXQmwY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "comments